      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلْغَمٌ</span></b>  [<i>Phlegm;] one of the four [natural constituents termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَبَائِع</span>; (S;) [i. e.] <i>one of the
humours</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْلَاط</span>) <i>of the body.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
hence, (tropical:)  <i>A heavy,</i> or <i>sluggish, person, who is a
